## 4. Deprecation & Sunset Timeline

- 2026-09: Sunset ALLCAPS canonical files (`ANCHOR.oo`, `FLOOR.oo`, `RULES.oot`,
  `NORTHSTAR.oot`, `REQUIREMENTS.oot`, `ROADMAP.oot`). All repos standardized on lowercase.
- 2026-09: Sunset root shadow directory `.docs/` and redundant subrepo `AGENT.md` files.
- 2026-10: Sunset legacy 10-pillar references across all historical audit docs.
- 2026-11: Deprecate non-sandboxed subprocess execution shims across all tooling.
